{"nodes": [{"id": "contributing_no_runtime_dependencies", "label": "No runtime dependencies, no network calls", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CONTRIBUTING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The deliverable is one file a non-developer can open, audit and email; a toolchain is the fastest way to lose that. Must work from a USB stick on a plane."}, {"id": "contributing_chart_colour_rules", "label": "Chart colour rules", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CONTRIBUTING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Categorical hues in fixed order never cycled; sequential ramps one hue; status colours reserved; never a dual-axis chart; every palette change re-validated for colour-vision deficiency."}, {"id": "contributing_every_chart_has_table_view", "label": "Every chart has a table view", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CONTRIBUTING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Colour is never the only encoding; every status chip carries an icon and a word."}, {"id": "contributing_derived_data_recomputed", "label": "Derived data is recomputed, never inherited", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CONTRIBUTING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When new issues arrive recompute the burndown and history row; fresh numbers under a stale chart is the worst failure mode this tool has."}, {"id": "contributing_adding_a_metric", "label": "Adding a metric procedure", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CONTRIBUTING.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Compute in derive(), render with a three-part data-tt tooltip, wire openDrill(), add S.t